WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.573
The headline numbers tell the whole story.

00:00:02.653 --> 00:00:09.964
Six hundred thirty-eight thousand human judgments
gathered over four thousand nine hundred twenty-one distinct faces.

00:00:10.044 --> 00:00:16.470
Twenty-two interpretable embedding dimensions
retained at nearly sixty-two percent validation accuracy.

00:00:16.550 --> 00:00:19.250
And when annotator identities are scrambled,

00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:24.303
accuracy falls from sixty-one point seven down to
fifty-two point eight percent,

00:00:24.383 --> 00:00:28.220
all achieved without ever training on a single
semantic label.
